-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Hey there, you're trying to compile librenderer

    Normally you don't need to, because librenderer is a
single header library (see 'Getting started' section in README.md)

    If you do plan to compile this library, run:

$ make librenderer.so

    Or

$ make librenderer.a

    For dynamic and static variants of the library respectively.

    You can also see what this library is capable of, try '$ make examples'
